<title>USA: Phillips exploring Shanghai pipe venture.</title>
<headline>Phillips exploring Shanghai pipe venture.</headline>
<dateline>BARTLESVILLE, Okla. 1997-03-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Phillips Petroleum Co said Tuesday it signed a letter of intent with Shanghai Petrochemical Co Ltd  calling for the two companies to study the feasibility of a jointly owned polyethylene pipe plant.</p>
<p>The plant would be built in the Pudong New Area of Shanghai using Phillips technology, the company said.</p>
<p>It said the plant would have an initial capacity of 24 million pounds a year with a possible increase to 44 million.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610.))</p>
